","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" alone still triggers a\nfetch that fails with \"Missing queryFn\" unless "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"enabled"},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" or a default query function has been\ndefined. A default query function only supplies "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":"; it doesn't defer the fetch on its own."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" resolves to."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" ends up as after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" runs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryKey"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"queryfn","text":"queryFn?","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UnusedSkipTokenOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = OmitKeyof<UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>, \"queryFn\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/queryOptions.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L48)\n\nThe options accepted by the `queryOptions` overload selected when no `initialData` is set and `queryFn` is\nnot `skipToken` — same as [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md), but `queryFn` may not be `skipToken`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### queryFn?\n\n```ts\noptional queryFn?: Exclude<UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>[\"queryFn\"], SkipToken | undefined>;\n```\n\n`skipToken` is not allowed as a value here — this overload is selected when no `initialData` is set. If\nyou don't intend to run the query yet, set `enabled: false` — omitting `queryFn` alone still triggers a\nfetch that fails with \"Missing queryFn\" unless `enabled` is `false` or a default query function has been\ndefined. A default query function only supplies `queryFn`; it doesn't defer the fetch on its own.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UnusedSkipTokenOptions\ntitle: UnusedSkipTokenOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UnusedSkipTokenOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey> = OmitKeyof<UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>, \"queryFn\"> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/queryOptions.ts:48](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/queryOptions.ts#L48)\n\nThe options accepted by the `queryOptions` overload selected when no `initialData` is set and `queryFn` is\nnot `skipToken` — same as [UndefinedInitialDataOptions](UndefinedInitialDataOptions.md), but `queryFn` may not be `skipToken`.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### queryFn?\n\n```ts\noptional queryFn?: Exclude<UseQueryOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey>[\"queryFn\"], SkipToken | undefined>;\n```\n\n`skipToken` is not allowed as a value here — this overload is selected when no `initialData` is set. If\nyou don't intend to run the query yet, set `enabled: false` — omitting `queryFn` alone still triggers a\nfetch that fails with \"Missing queryFn\" unless `enabled` is `false` or a default query function has been\ndefined. A default query function only supplies `queryFn`; it doesn't defer the fetch on its own.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your `queryFn` resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\nThe type of your `queryKey`.\n"}
